WEBVTT

00:00:04.344 --> 00:00:11.637
In the West we have become very speedy, no doubt.

00:00:11.718 --> 00:00:26.493
And to bring down this speed we have to use meditative process

00:00:29.631 --> 00:00:34.741
that we feel our peace within ourselves.

00:00:39.530 --> 00:00:45.102
Also the thoughts are bombarding our minds

00:00:47.334 --> 00:00:59.362
and we react very fast to others

00:00:59.443 --> 00:01:02.602
and to these thoughts.

00:01:05.110 --> 00:01:09.588
So one has to be aware.

00:01:11.421 --> 00:01:16.706
One has to be knowing what is happening within yourself.

00:01:21.672 --> 00:01:25.804
That the thoughts are bombarding you.

00:01:26.999 --> 00:01:31.341
You are trying to ascend,

00:01:33.489 --> 00:01:40.404
and you find it very difficult to get rid of the thoughts.

00:01:44.769 --> 00:01:48.164
The thought process can start

00:01:50.195 --> 00:01:56.029
by your conditioning or by your ego. Only two problems.

00:02:03.603 --> 00:02:08.772
And you are the one who is under the challenge.

00:02:14.146 --> 00:02:19.208
So you have got these simple people in the village

00:02:20.768 --> 00:02:24.255
who start watching everything

00:02:26.625 --> 00:02:29.485
but they do not react.

00:02:30.296 --> 00:02:36.159
If you do not react then your thoughts will give up.

00:02:39.105 --> 00:02:44.376
So the first thing should be to watch yourself

00:02:45.650 --> 00:02:49.285
that you are not reacting,

00:02:51.765 --> 00:02:57.628
but you are experiencing and enjoying the silence,

00:03:00.007 --> 00:03:08.236
the subtleties, the beauty, the glory of your being,

00:03:08.317 --> 00:03:13.122
as well as whatever is around you.

00:03:15.807 --> 00:03:20.475
You don't have to force yourself to break this habit,

00:03:23.928 --> 00:03:27.916
but just to be on the watch out.

00:03:30.923 --> 00:03:36.385
It's not necessary to talk too much about it also.

00:03:40.863 --> 00:03:44.321
Nor it is necessary

00:03:48.783 --> 00:03:52.956
to think about anything.

00:03:53.639 --> 00:03:59.034
Because supposing you see a tree. So it's a tree only.

00:04:00.178 --> 00:04:03.638
What are we going to think about it?

00:04:03.789 --> 00:04:08.956
And whatever we may think about it, it's going to be the tree.

00:04:12.231 --> 00:04:17.855
So there's no harm in appearing little bit stupid. Doesn't matter.

00:04:17.956 --> 00:04:24.800
But this is the basic thing is that when we start analyzing

00:04:24.881 --> 00:04:36.712
we are breaking our own nerves and poisoning our own mind and brain.

00:04:41.140 --> 00:04:49.513
So to watch something without analysis, without thinking about it, is reality.

00:04:53.303 --> 00:05:02.512
If you can achieve that point, where you watch
everything without reacting, you are in reality.

00:05:07.706 --> 00:05:18.650
And then only the penetration into the subtleties of your surroundings,

00:05:18.731 --> 00:05:26.586
of your relationships, your friendships,

00:05:26.666 --> 00:05:31.558
the whole universe, dawns upon you.

00:05:37.029 --> 00:05:41.339
So to judge others, to think of others —

00:05:41.420 --> 00:05:47.111
what they are doing, what's wrong with them —

00:05:48.734 --> 00:05:57.556
about anything whatsoever you may think is wrong, is not going to be corrected.

00:05:59.832 --> 00:06:05.035
Like I know some people who are specially bureaucrats,

00:06:05.115 --> 00:06:11.665
they are traveling supposing by the car, then they will say,

00:06:11.745 --> 00:06:16.654
"I think, you see, this road should have gone this way."

00:06:17.289 --> 00:06:22.280
Or, "I think it would have been nice if this house was facing the other way."

00:06:22.361 --> 00:06:25.453
But it's not, you see.

00:06:26.232 --> 00:06:27.433
It is not going to face.

00:06:30.169 --> 00:06:33.725
It is going to be the way it is.

00:06:33.806 --> 00:06:37.824
So what is the use of wasting your brain,

00:06:37.910 --> 00:06:43.101
your mind, your thought, in suggesting something

00:06:43.182 --> 00:06:46.257
which doesn't work out?

00:06:47.386 --> 00:06:50.680
And never going to work out either.

00:06:52.191 --> 00:06:55.143
So when we start like, "I think

00:06:57.048 --> 00:07:00.385
these trees should have been little taller,"

00:07:00.466 --> 00:07:02.365
but they are not.

00:07:05.604 --> 00:07:12.799
"I think

00:07:12.879 --> 00:07:18.231
that the crows should stop their noise."

00:07:18.317 --> 00:07:20.270
They will not.

00:07:22.928 --> 00:07:25.508
So just accept it.

00:07:25.589 --> 00:07:33.062
Acceptance is the way we are going to enjoy.

00:07:34.049 --> 00:07:37.047
But acceptance doesn't mean tolerance,

00:07:37.128 --> 00:07:42.510
because tolerance means you have to work very hard

00:07:43.442 --> 00:07:47.465
to accept that the trees are of the same height.

00:07:47.546 --> 00:07:50.735
They can't grow. It's too much for you.

00:07:50.816 --> 00:07:57.768
When you say, "I have to tolerate it," you see, because my mind doesn't accept.

00:08:03.015 --> 00:08:10.021
So acceptance as it is, whatever you see. Acceptance.

00:08:10.102 --> 00:08:14.025
And that is how people grow, I have seen, those who start accepting.

00:08:14.106 --> 00:08:15.860
That's the sign.

00:08:15.941 --> 00:08:19.424
That's the sign of their strength

00:08:19.505 --> 00:08:24.918
and their depth, like the propensity of this Mother Earth.

00:08:25.464 --> 00:08:27.866
She is what she is.

00:08:33.492 --> 00:08:37.101
And she bears whatever is there.

00:08:41.600 --> 00:08:49.994
If you put a heavy thing on her, she'll put equal and opposite force and bear it.

00:08:50.075 --> 00:08:52.489
She doesn't say, "I'm tolerating it.

00:08:52.570 --> 00:08:57.942
I'm exerting any pressure," but she's just accepting.

00:09:02.888 --> 00:09:09.110
So the witnessing and awareness develops

00:09:09.191 --> 00:09:14.385
when we start just accepting things as they are.

00:09:15.634 --> 00:09:18.955
"I think" doesn't work out.

00:09:22.975 --> 00:09:28.513
"I think it would have been better like this" doesn't work out.